# Quality checks — aiops-documentation

Before declaring any task done, run from the repository root and fix every ERROR reported.

## Commands

```bash
make docs-validate
```

Optional when you changed many links: `make docs-check-links`.

## Exit criteria

| Tool | Criterion |
| --- | --- |
| `make docs-validate` (`scripts/docs_lint.py validate`) | No ERROR on governed docs |
| Bilingual trees | Same semantic change in `docs/en/` and `docs/pt-BR/` when both exist |

## Common fixes

- Broken relative Markdown links → correct the path or add the missing file
- Manifest path missing → add the file or remove the stale manifest entry
- Status token not in `DRAFT` / `REVIEW` / `ACCEPTED` / `DEPRECATED` / `ARCHIVED` → use a allowed token
- Unilateral `ACCEPTED` on a new methodology page → leave `DRAFT` or `REVIEW` for human review
